  m_Name: 10_DungeonLoot
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GuideStep
  <sceneName>k__BackingField: Dungeon
  <catPath>k__BackingField:
  - DungeonCat
  <leadsPlayer>k__BackingField: 0
  <followsPlayer>k__BackingField: 1
  <lines>k__BackingField:
  - Well fought! They drop coins and Wisp Essence. Walk over them to pick them up.
  - 'Sell the Essence to the merchant. Potions go on keys 1 to 7: press the key to
    drink one.'
  - 'Careful: on some visits the King Wisp haunts these halls. He''s strong and calls
    more Wisps.'
  - Beat him and he drops a Marble Stone. The town needs it to rebuild.
  - Fall here and you wake at the dungeon entrance, a few coins lighter.
  - Clear the dungeon, rebuild the town. I'll be around.
  <completion>k__BackingField: 0
